{"id": "tea:avadhuta-upanisad:1", "source": "src:avadhuta-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "1"}, "paraphrase": "Sāṅkṛti asks Dattātreya who the avadhūta is; the name is explained: from imperishability (a), excellence (va), having shaken off (dhūta) the bonds of saṃsāra, and being the meaning of 'that you are' (ta).", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "realized"}, "types": ["ultimate", "sound-language"], "original": {"text": "akṣaratvād vareṇyatvād dhūtasaṃsārabandhanāt | tattvamasyādilakṣyatvād avadhūta itīryate", "script": "IAST", "edition": "Īśādiviṃśottaraśatopaniṣadaḥ (Nirṇayasāgara collection of 120 Upaniṣads), South Indian recension carrying Upaniṣad Brahmayogin's opening maṅgala verses; e-text github.com/sanskrit/raw_etexts vedaH/misc/upaniShat/mixedPF/108_Upanishads.md", "licence": "text public domain; e-text licence unstated"}, "concepts": ["cpt:avadhuta"], "teachers": ["tch:dattatreya", "tch:sankrti"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:avadhuta-upanisad:2", "source": "src:avadhuta-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "2"}, "paraphrase": "The yogin who has transcended the castes and stages and abides always in the Self is called beyond castes and stages (ativarṇāśramin), the avadhūta.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "realized"}, "types": ["ethics", "karma-liberation"], "concepts": ["cpt:ativarnasrami"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:avadhuta-upanisad:23", "source": "src:avadhuta-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "23"}, "paraphrase": "Or, though his work is done, out of a wish to help the world he may keep to the path taught by scripture — what harm is there to him?", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "realized"}, "types": ["ethics", "dispute"], "disputes": ["dsp:lokasangraha-for-the-renouncer"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:avadhuta-upanisad:24-26", "source": "src:avadhuta-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "24-26"}, "paraphrase": "Let the body attend to worship, bathing, cleanliness and alms; let speech repeat the praṇava and read the Upaniṣads; I am the witness, I do nothing and cause nothing to be done.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["ethics", "consciousness-mind"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:avadhuta-upanisad:27-32", "source": "src:avadhuta-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "27-32"}, "paraphrase": "'Blessed am I, blessed am I!' — the knower rejoices that sorrow is gone, ignorance fled, nothing remains to be done or gained.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["karma-liberation"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:avadhuta-upanisad:3-5", "source": "src:avadhuta-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "3-5"}, "paraphrase": "Bliss is his bird-body — joy its head, delight and great delight its wings, Brahman its support; not by works, offspring or wealth but by renunciation some have reached immortality.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["ultimate"], "cross_refs": ["tea:kaivalya-upanisad:1.3"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:avadhuta-upanisad:33", "source": "src:avadhuta-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "33"}, "paraphrase": "One who studies this is purified even of the gravest sins; knowing this he may live as he wills.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["karma-liberation"], "concepts": ["cpt:svecchacara"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "high", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:avadhuta-upanisad:6-8", "source": "src:avadhuta-upanisad", "location": {"ref": "6-8"}, "paraphrase": "Moving at will is his wandering; clothed or naked; for him there is no right or wrong in the ordinary sense; desires enter him as rivers the ocean.", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "realized"}, "types": ["ethics"], "concepts": ["cpt:svecchacara"], "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": [], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "moderate", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "coverage": ["A2"], "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U04-minor-upanisads"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
